{"parse": {"title": "Guilds", "pageid": 5803, "revid": 41715, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Guild_Rankings\">Guild Rankings</span></h1>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Guild_Box\">Guild Box</span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Clan_Ranking_Badges\">Clan Ranking Badges</span></h2>\n<p>Guild rankings in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://animeadventures.fandom.com/wiki/Anime_Adventures_Wiki\"><i>Anime Adventures</i></a> are determined by your clan's total performance and are displayed through unique badges. Here’s a breakdown of the ranking system:\n</p>\n<center>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Badge\n</th>\n<th>Ranking\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/f2/Bronze.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101174029\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Bronze\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/f2/Bronze.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/61?cb=20250101174029\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"61\" height=\"61\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Bronze.png\" data-image-key=\"Bronze.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <b>Bronze</b>\n</td>\n<td>50,000+\n</td>\n<td>Awarded to clans ranked at 50,000 or higher.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/4a/SilverGuild.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101174113\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"SilverGuild\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/4a/SilverGuild.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20250101174113\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"SilverGuild.png\" data-image-key=\"SilverGuild.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <b>Silver</b>\n</td>\n<td>49,999–26,000\n</td>\n<td>For clans ranked between 50,000 and 26,000.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/70/GoldGuild.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101174145\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"GoldGuild\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/70/GoldGuild.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/61?cb=20250101174145\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"61\" height=\"61\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"GoldGuild.png\" data-image-key=\"GoldGuild.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <b>Gold</b>\n</td>\n<td>25,999–11,000\n</td>\n<td>Reserved for clans achieving ranks between 26,000 and 11,000.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/ed/PlatGuild.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101174216\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"PlatGuild\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"62\" height=\"62\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PlatGuild.png\" data-image-key=\"PlatGuild.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/ed/PlatGuild.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/62?cb=20250101174216\" /></a></span> <b>Plat</b>\n</td>\n<td>10,999-1,000\n</td>\n<td>Awarded to top-performing clans ranked between 11,000 and 1,000.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/17/DiamondGuild.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101174302\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DiamondGuild\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"62\" height=\"62\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DiamondGuild.png\" data-image-key=\"DiamondGuild.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/17/DiamondGuild.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/62?cb=20250101174302\" /></a></span> <b>Diamond</b>\n</td>\n<td>999–101\n</td>\n<td>Represents the highest-ranked clans, just short of the top 100.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/ee/MasterGuild.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101174325\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"MasterGuild\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"MasterGuild.png\" data-image-key=\"MasterGuild.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/ee/MasterGuild.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20250101174325\" /></a></span> <b>Master</b>\n</td>\n<td>Top 100\n</td>\n<td>The ultimate badge, awarded to the top 100 clans in the global rankings.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_Improve_Your_Guild_Ranking\">How to Improve Your Guild Ranking</span></h2></center>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261023120828\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 40/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.3